  "title": "Embracing Circular Economy: The Role of Azogen in Sustainable Farming",
  "summary": "Azogen is reshaping sustainable farming by turning agricultural waste into valuable resources—pure water and organic nitrogen fertilizer. Rooted in circular economy principles, it reduces reliance on synthetic fertilizers, improves soil health, and supports water conservation, offering farmers a practical path to productivity and resilience.",
